{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1252604-exalted-30-day-art-challenge","id":1252604,"title":"Exalted 30 Day Art Challenge!","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-09-08T14:31:58-07:00","id":1252604,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon3.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> Exalted 30 Day Art Challenge!","content":"<span style=\"color:#444444\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">There are so many great Dungeons &amp; Dragons-themed art challenges out there that I decided that Exalted needed one of its own as well! Feel free to interpret these topics as loosely as you like or replace topics that don\u2019t vogue with your favorite edition or subject matter.<br /> </span></span></span><br /> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"color:#444444\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"><img src=\"https://78.media.tumblr.com/5385aa684f1eec2bc3050d8e801bc80b/tumblr_peoyqugSLR1wp3cp4o1_r2_1280.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></span></span></span></div><ul><li>Tag your art with #ExaltedArtChallenge or Exalted Art Challenge (if spaces are allowed in your tags) as well so others can easily find your work!</li> <li><span style=\"color:#444444\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">I\u2019d love to see and share what you all do, so feel free to tag me on Twitter and Tumblr as </span></span></span><b>@theuncrucified</b><span style=\"color:#444444\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"> !</span></span></span></li> </ul><span style=\"color:#444444\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"><span style=\"color:#444444\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-siz